|---|---|
| Discover | Nearby, global, and trending content discovery |
| Interact | Posts, comments, reactions, and polls |
| Play | QuickMind, This or That, and Mystery Word |
| Explore | Discovery through available communities and approved location experiences |
| Evolve | Profile, activity-related information, and currently approved account experiences |

**Important:** Evolve must not expose future-only achievements, collectible economies, virtual pets, or progression systems as functioning MVP features.

The implementation agent must verify the Master PRD's exact MVP feature mapping before assigning additional functionality to these navigation destinations.

